   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "There are no obvious signs of major accident damage, flood damage, neglect or abuse. The vehicle drives and performs well. I was able to test drive the vehicle for several miles with a top speed reaching 75 mph in the average speed of 55 mph. The engine runs strong with no misfires, abnormal engine noises or smoke from the exhaust. The transmission shifts smooth with no slippage or shutters and all transmission options function correctly. All electronic components and safety features show to be working. There are no ECM codes stored in the vehicles computer system and all onboard monitors are complete.The vehicle shows good signs of reliability if the right amount of TLC is up kept. As with any used vehicle our technician was able to find some issues of notes. Please look over all notes and notes attached to the pictures"
  }
